    <briefdescription>
<para>A set of sufficient conditions for a property to hold on an expression. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each <ref refid="d9/dfb/structlamina_1_1QueryInterface_1_1ConditionSet" kindref="compound">ConditionSet</ref> represents one alternative set of conditions. If all conditions within a single <ref refid="d9/dfb/structlamina_1_1QueryInterface_1_1ConditionSet" kindref="compound">ConditionSet</ref> are satisfied, the target property holds. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
